Root cause:
In aie2_create_context(), when mailbox channel creation fails, the error handling calls aie_destroy_context() which expects a valid mailbox channel pointer (non-NULL). Since the channel pointer is still NULL, a NULL pointer dereference occurs when aie_destroy_context() attempts to stop or destroy the channel.

